      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ADMINISTRATION Functions and powers of Director General and other officers"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "III",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "IMPOSITION OF TOURISM TAX Imposition of tourism tax"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A tax to be known as tourism tax shall be charged and levied on a tourist staying at any accommodation premises made available by an operator at the rate fixed by the Minister in accordance with section 8."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to subsection (3), it shall be the duty of the tourist to pay the tourism tax to the operator."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where more than one tourist are staying in the same accommodation at the same time and the tourism tax for that accommodation has been paid by any one of the tourists, the other tourists staying in the same accommodation at the same time shall not be liable to pay tourism tax for that accommodation. Duty of operator to collect tourism tax and pay tourism tax collected to Director General"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to subsection 6(2), it shall be the duty of every operator who provides accommodation to a tourist in an accommodation premises to collect the tourism tax from the tourist."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every operator shall pay the tourism tax collected or liable to be collected under this Act to the Director General. Rate of tourism tax"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, with the concurrence of the minister charged with the responsibility for tourism, by order published in the Gazette, fix the rate of the tourism tax to be charged and levied under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of subsection (1), “fix” includes “increase” or “reduce”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any order made under subsection (1) shall be laid before the Dewan Rakyat at the next meeting of the Dewan Rakyat and shall, at the expiration of one hundred and twenty days of being so laid or of such extended period as the Dewan Rakyat may by resolution direct, cease to have effect if and insofar as it is not confirmed by resolution passed by the Dewan Rakyat within the said one hundred and twenty days or, if such period has been extended, within such extended period."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where an order ceases to have effect in whole or in part as provided in subsection (3), any tourism tax charged and levied in pursuance of the order or such part thereof, as the case may be, as ceases to have effect shall, subject to the provisions of subsection (5), be refundable to the persons by whom the tourism tax was paid."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Unless the Minister otherwise directs, no tourism tax refundable under subsection (4) shall be refunded unless the person by whom the tourism tax was paid makes a claim in writing to the Director General within one year from the date on which the order ceases to have effect in whole or in part and the claim shall contain such particulars as the Director General may require. Power of Minister to exempt"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, in any particular case and subject to such conditions as he deems fit to impose—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "exempt any tourist or class of tourists from the payment of the whole or any part of the tourism tax;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "exempt any operator or class of operator from collecting the whole or any part of the tourism tax; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "exempt any operator or class of operator from the requirement to register under Part IV."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_III__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, in any particular case and subject to such conditions as he deems fit to impose, exempt any person from all or any of the provisions of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General shall have the superintendence of all matters relating to tourism tax, subject to the direction and control of the Minister."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to the general direction and supervision of the Director General, all officers of customs appointed under section 3 of the Customs Act 1967 and holding the rank of Superintendent or any rank higher than that of Superintendent, shall have and exercise all powers conferred on the Director General under this Act other than those conferred by sections 21 and 66."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "It shall be the duty of any officer of customs to enforce and ensure due compliance with the provisions of this Act and to make all due enquiries in relation thereto."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every person employed on any duty or service relating to the tourism tax by the order or with the concurrence of the Director General, whether previously or subsequently expressed, shall be deemed to be the proper officer for that duty or service. Public servants"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All public officers while discharging any duty or service relating to the tourism tax shall be deemed to be public servants within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Authority cards, etc., to be produced"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every officer of customs when discharging his duties shall, if not in uniform, on demand made by any person, declare his office and produce to the person the authority card or badge prescribed under section 8a of the Customs Act 1967."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "It shall not be an offence for any person to refuse to comply with any request, demand or order made by any officer of customs acting or purporting to act under this Act if such officer is not in uniform and refuses to declare his office and produce his authority card or badge on demand being made by the person."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "REGISTRATION Liability of operator to be registered"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every operator shall be liable to be registered under this Act and for such purpose shall apply to the Director General to be registered, in the manner as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The application referred to in subsection (1) shall be made within thirty days from the date the operator operates the accommodation premises."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any operator who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding thirty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both. Liability of operator operating accommodation premises before commencement of the Act to be registered"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every operator who immediately before the coming into operation of this Part operates accommodation premises shall, within thirty days from the date of the coming into operation of this Part, apply to the Director General to be registered, in the manner as may be prescribed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any operator who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding thirty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both. Registration of operator"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General shall register any operator who makes an application under section 10 or 11 with effect from the first day of the following month after the application is submitted to the Director General."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding sections 10 and 11, the Director General shall have the power to register—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any operator who operates accommodation premises registered as tourist accommodation premises under section 31c of the Tourism Industry Act 1992; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any operator who is not registered under subsection (1) or paragraph (a), with effect from the first day of the following month after the information relating to paragraph (a) or (b) became known or made known to the Director General."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General shall notify the person registered under this section in the manner as he deems fit. Cancellation of registration"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An operator who ceases to operate an accommodation premises or is exempted under section 9 shall notify the Director General in writing of the fact and the date thereof within thirty days from the date of cessation or exemption, as the case may be."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the notification under subsection (1), the Director General may cancel the operator’s registration from such date as the Director General may determine."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "IX",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_49",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_51",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TRIALS AND PROCEEDINGS Prosecution"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_49",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "49",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No prosecution for an offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor. Jurisdiction to try offences"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any written law to the contrary, a Sessions Court shall have jurisdiction to try any offence under this Act and to impose the full punishment for the offence. Conviction under other laws"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nothing in this Act shall prevent the prosecution, conviction and punishment of any person according to the provisions of any other written law for the time being in force. Evidential provisions"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_8"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In any proceedings under this Act any statement purporting to be signed by the Director General or an officer authorized by the Director General which forms part of or is annexed to the information, complaint or statement of claim, shall be prima facie evidence of any fact stated therein."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A transcript of any particulars contained in a return or other document relating to tourism tax, if it is certified under the hand of the Director General or an officer authorized by the Director General to be a true copy of the particulars, shall be prima facie evidence of the facts stated therein."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No statement made or document produced by or on behalf of any person shall be inadmissible in evidence against the person in any proceedings against him to which this section applies, by reason only of the fact that he was or may have been induced to make the statement or produce the document by any inducement, promise or threat made by any person having any official duty under, or being appointed for the due administration of, this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nothing in this Act shall affect the operation of Chapter IX of Part III of the Evidence Act 1950."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where in any proceedings it is proved that any false statement or entry has been made in any return furnished under this Act by or on behalf of any person or in any books of account or records of any person—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the person shall be presumed, until the contrary is proved, to have made the false statement or entry, or to have caused the false statement or entry to be made, or to have allowed the false statement or entry to be made, with intent to evade the payment of tourism tax or to obtain a refund of tourism tax to which the person is not entitled, as the case may be; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other person who made any false statement or entry shall be presumed, until the contrary is proved, to have made the false statement or entry with intent to assist the first-mentioned person to evade the payment of tourism tax or to obtain a refund of tourism tax to which he is not entitled, as the case may be."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any officer of customs has obtained any document or other evidence in exercise of his powers under this Act, the document or copy of the document or other evidence, as the case may be, shall be prima facie evidence of the facts stated therein, notwithstanding anything to the contrary in any written law."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any document which is to be used in any proceedings against any person for an offence under this Act is in a language other than the national language or English language, a translation of the document into the national language or English language shall be admissible in evidence where the translation is accompanied by a certificate of the person who translated the document setting out that the translation is an accurate, faithful and true translation and the translation had been done by the person at the instance of any officer of customs."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection (7) shall apply to a document which is translated, regardless of whether the document was made in or outside Malaysia, or whether the translation was done in or outside Malaysia, or whether possession of the document was obtained by any officer of customs in or outside Malaysia. Evidentiary value of copies of electronic notice"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the avoidance of doubt, any electronic notice or any electronic record of an electronic notice or any copy or print out thereof shall not be inadmissible in evidence merely on the basis that it was filed, lodged or transmitted through the electronic service, without the delivery of any equivalent document or counterpart in paper form."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any other written law, in any proceedings under this Act, any electronic notice or any electronic record of an electronic notice or any copy or print out thereof which is—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "certified by the Director General to contain all or any information filed, lodged or transmitted through the electronic service in accordance with this Act; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_53__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "duly authenticated in the manner specified in section 63 or is otherwise authenticated in the manner provided in the Evidence Act 1950 for the authentication of document produced by computer, shall be prima facie evidence of the facts stated therein. Imprisonment for non-payment of fine"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Criminal Procedure Code, the period of imprisonment imposed by any court in respect of the non-payment of any fine under this Act, or in respect of the default of a sufficient distress to satisfy any such fine, shall be such period of such description, as in the opinion of the court will satisfy the justice of the case, but shall not exceed in any case the maximum period as follows:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the fine does not exceed five thousand ringgit, the maximum period shall be two months;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the fine exceeds five thousand ringgit but does not exceed ten thousand ringgit, the maximum period shall be four months; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the fine exceeds ten thousand ringgit but does not exceed twenty thousand ringgit, the maximum period shall be six months, with two additional months for every ten thousand ringgit after the first twenty thousand ringgit of the fine. No costs or damages arising from seizure to be recoverable unless seizure without reasonable or probable cause"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No person shall, in any proceedings before any court in respect of the seizure of any thing seized in the exercise or the purported exercise of any power conferred under this Act, be entitled to the costs of the proceedings or to any damages or other relief other than an order for the return of the thing or the payment of the value unless the seizure was made without reasonable or probable cause. Compounding of offences"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, with the approval of the Public Prosecutor, make regulations prescribing—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any offence under this Act and any regulations made under this Act that may be compounded;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the criteria for compounding such offence; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the method and procedure for compounding such offence."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General or a senior officer of customs may, with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor, compound any offence committed by any person under this Act and prescribed to be a compoundable offence by making a written offer to the person suspected of committing the offence to compound the offence on payment to the Director General of an amount of money not exceeding fifty per cent of the amount of the maximum fine for that offence within the time specified in the offer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An offer under subsection (2) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed, but before any prosecution for it has been instituted, and if the amount specified in the offer is not paid within the time specified in the offer or within any extended period as the Director General may grant, prosecution for the offence may be instituted at any time after that against the person to whom the offer was made."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where an offence has been compounded under subsection (2), no prosecution shall after that be instituted in respect of the offence against the person to whom the offer to compound was made. Court order"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "57",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any person is found guilty of an offence under this Act, the court before which the person is found guilty shall order the person to pay to the Director General the amount of tourism tax or any penalty due and payable under this Act, if any, as certified by the Director General and the tourism tax or penalty shall be recoverable in the same manner as a fine as provided under section 283 of the Criminal Procedure Code."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In addition to subsection (1), the court has civil jurisdiction to the extent of the amount and the order is enforceable in all respects as a final judgment of the court in favour of the Director General."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any person is found not guilty of an offence under this Act, and if he has paid the amount of tourism tax due and payable or penalty payable under this Act pursuant to section 48, in respect of the offence charged, the court may order the amount paid to be refunded to such person unless a notice of appeal against the decision is filed within the specified time. Obligation of secrecy"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "58",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except as provided under section 59, the name, identification card number, passport number, address of an informer or any other information which can lead to identity of an informer and the substance of the information received from an informer shall be kept secret and shall not be disclosed by any officer of customs or any person who in the ordinary course of his duties comes into possession of or has control of or access to the information to any person except the officer of customs authorized by the Director General."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding thirty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. Protection of informers from discovery"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "59",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except as hereinafter provided, no witness in any civil or criminal proceedings shall be obliged or permitted to disclose the name, address or any information of an informer or the substance of the information received from him or to state any matter which might lead to his discovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If any books, documents or papers which are produced in evidence or liable to inspection in any civil or criminal proceeding contain any entry in which any informer is named or described or which might lead to his discovery, the court shall cause all the passages to be concealed from view or to be obliterated so far only as may be necessary to protect the informer from discovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_IX__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If in the trial for any offence under this Act, the court, after full enquiry into the case, believes that the informer wilfully made in his complaint a material statement which he knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true, or if in any other proceedings the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties thereto without the discovery of the informer, it shall be lawful for the court to require the production of the original complaint, if in writing, and permit enquiry, and require full disclosure, concerning the informer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Tourism Tax Act 2017."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different Parts or different provisions of this Act. Interpretation"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“prescribed” means prescribed by regulations made under this Act; “document” has the meaning assigned to it in section 3 of the Evidence Act 1950 [Act 56]; “electronic” has the meaning assigned to it in section 5 of the Electronic Government Activities Act 2007 [Act 680]; “Director General” means the Director General of Customs and Excise appointed under subsection 3(1) of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235]; “computer” has the meaning assigned to it in section 3 of the Evidence Act 1950; “Minister” means the Minister charged with the responsibility for finance; “person” includes an individual, a firm, a society, an association, a company and other body of persons; “senior officer of customs” has the meaning assigned to it in subsection 2(1) of the Customs Act 1967; “officer of customs” has the meaning assigned to it in subsection 2(1) of the Customs Act 1967; “tourist” has the meaning assigned to it in subsection 2(1) of the Tourism Industry Act 1992 [Act 482]; “operator” means any person who operates accommodation premises; “accommodation premises” has the meaning assigned to it in subsection 2(1) of the Tourism Industry Act 1992; “surcharge” means the surcharge imposed under section 26; “taxable period” means the period as specified in section 18."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "V",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_14",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_15",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_16",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_17",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_18",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_19",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_V__cl_20"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "INVOICES, RECORDS, RETURNS AND ASSESSMENT Invoice, receipt or other document"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/12/eng@/~part_VI",
